    "findings": [
      "Publish 14.1 derives player combat difficulty from learned weapon skill modifiers rather than an NGE profession level.",
      "Publish 14.1 group difficulty is the strongest member plus one fifth of each additional member's difficulty.",
      "The project mission rule maps learned PRE-CU combat-box point costs to a hidden retained-content scale, with elite combat boxes weighted above Brawler and Marksman boxes.",
      "Retained expansion content may consume the hidden adapter for authored creature scaling, but the adapter is not a player stat and never reads getLevel(player)."
    ]
